      variants (pill / dot / compact). The web source is presentational over a single live hook (no network fetch),
      so it has no loading/empty/error/stale fetch chrome to invent; the prompt's loading/empty/error/stale/offline
      states map onto the connection states (loading -> unknown, error/offline -> disconnected, stale -> connected
      via the monitor's 2-minute freshness fold). All four LiveConnectionState branches are projected + tested.
  [x] Hooks bind via the shared P1/S8 state-holder layer: ILiveIndicatorSource (web useLiveConnection) with a
      production MonitorLiveIndicatorSource over the Core LiveConnectionMonitor and a StaticLiveIndicatorSource for
      headless/preview; IMotionPreferenceSource (web prefers-reduced-motion); localizer = P1/S10 ILocalizer. The
      view performs no I/O and reads no stream itself.
  [x] Every i18n key from source resolves through the P1/S10 facade with the web second-arg fallback verbatim:
      translation.live.{connected,reconnecting,disconnected,unknown} (all four ALREADY present in
